{{also|Lolita}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From the title character, Dolores “{{m|en|Lolita}}” Haze, of {{w|Vladimir Nabokov|Vladimir Nabokov's}} 1955 novel ''{{w|Lolita}}''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A childlike female character in Japanese anime and manga, a loli can be a kid or an adult.
#: {{syn|en|jailbait|nymph|nymphet|nymphette}}
# {{lb|en|fashion}} A follower of [[lolita fashion]].

